�Enas suggrapheas pou graphei gia enan suggraphea pou graphei gia enan suggraphea.
Mia skoteine pule sto guali enos palaiou kathrepte.
E lakhtara gia to antamoma me ten nekre oikogeneia.
Mia diabolike magissa kai mia oneirike neraida, mesa sta bouna tes ellenikes upaithrou.
H stigme opou kerdizeis mia oloklere zoe.
H stigme opou khaneis mia oloklere zoe.
Ena matomeno deipno.
Dolophonikoi philoi.
Orgismenoi psukhopompoi.
Apotropaia egklemata kai krateteria mesa ste ge.
Taxidia me magika manitaria stis rages tes psukhedeleias.
Anthropoi pou paleuoun me uperphusikous alla kai me kathemerinous phobous se mia sulloge brabeumenon kai kainourion diegematon gia to ti mas perimenei -khamogelontas- na koimethoume...
Gia to ti krubetai sta skotadia...
Kato apo to krebati."�
�O Iasonas Lemoniates ethele na epistrepsei. Na epistrepsei sten elit opou aneke kai na apodeixei pos den etan enas logoklopos. Enas apateoniskos. Ti kai an eikhan perasei skhedon 50 khronia apo ten... parexegese; Tha ekane ta panta gia na petukhei, opos to eikhe kanei kai tote. <>etan to megaleiodes ergo tou. Oi praxeis tou parelthontos omos, kharaxan to mellon.
Ena mellon zophero pou o altrouismos egine monodromos kai e epibiose upokhreose. Den uperkhe pia khoros kai khronos gia na klapsourizei e Katerina te zoe pou den eikhe zesei. Eprepe na bgei mprosta.
Enas phrikiastikos polemos molis eikhe xekinesei.
Anthropoi molusmenoi me misos, epnigan sto aima kathe ti diaphoretiko apo te diestrammene metallaxe tous. Maniakoi bitzilantides, oriothetousan adiaperasta sunora gia ten pole-kratos tou Peiraia. Tou Peiraia tou Alke.
Ena kauto Augoustiatiko proino tou 2010, oi zoes olon allaxan mia gia panta."�
�Khontres stales brokhes arkhisan na pephtoun, kanontas ta makria mallia tou Tomas na kollane sten plate tou. To blemma tou karphotheke s' ena khruso nomisma pou xekhorize sto soro ton anthropinon oston. Mia kokkine petra stolize to kentro tou nomismatos. Pos kai den to eikhan mazepsei oi arkhaiologoi anarotetheke, kai gematos periergeia eskupse kai to pere sten palame tou. Koitaxe triguro, ekhontas ten aisthese oti kapoios ton parakolouthouse, kai aggixe ten mikre kokkine petra* eniose dunato pono kai tou xephuge mia krauge. Oi stagones tes brokhes stamatesan na pephtoun kai ta panta guro tou tulikhtekan se pukno skotadi. Pou eimai; Ti einai auto to meros; Phobamai...
O Tomas, e Roxane kai o Loukas briskontai apo te mia stigme sten alle ste Mekta, te khora ton oneiron. Oi ippotes kai ta xotika pauoun na einai meros tes phantasias ton trion ephebon kai ginontai mia epikindune pragmatikoteta. Pou tha odegesei telika auto to apisteuto taxidi pou xekinese apo aple periergeia; Tha katapheroun na epistrepsoun pote piso ste Skotia;"�
�Dodeka allokota diegemata, dodeka paraxenes istories...
1. "To tromaktiko mustiko tou Ainstain"
Oi skismenes selides enos paliou emerologiou pou epesan tukhaia sta kheria mou, apokaluptoun stoikheia gia ena tromaktiko mustiko sto opoio emplekontai o Almpert Ainstain kai to Amerikaniko Polemiko Nautiko!
2."Amar"
Enas adistaktos Marokinos gkagkster einai etoimos gia ola, okhi omos gia ten pragmatikoteta pou antikruzei xaphnika mprosta tou...
3. "To domatio me tous kathrephtes"
Uparkhei arage pepromeno; Ginontai ta oneira pragmatikoteta; Ti einai arage pio odunero; O thanatos e e zoe; Oi apanteseis dinontai sto domatio me tous kathrephtes...
4. "Ena mpouketo orkhidees apo to pouthena"
Otan ena mpouketo orkhidees apostelletai ston paralepte tou apo ton allo kosmo...
5. "Thanasimo oneiro"
To oneiro mpleketai me ten pragmatikoteta kai to uposuneideto... E mepos telika ola einai paikhnidia tou mualou;
6. "O Dias sto Facebook"
E paraxene istoria mias photographias sto Facebook kai e skhese tou Dia me ena Germano rok star kai ena pentakhrono agori.
7. "E Alike to ethele polu"
Merikes phores den einai kalo na epithumoume kati para polu, epeide mporei telika e epithumia mas na pragmatopoiethei...
8. "Skholike ekdrome"
Kapoio phobero atukhema se skholike ekdrome odegei ena koritsaki se metathanatia empeiria.
9. "O katadioktes tou Tzak"
E tukhaia sullepse tou adistakhtou egklematia Tzak apokaluptei ena metaphusiko dromeno.
10. "E gunaika pou epese apo psela"
Poia istoria mporei na krubetai piso apo ten ptose mias gunaikas apo to parathuro;
11. "Mekhri pou tha paei aute e balitsa;"
Oi komikotragikes peripeteies mias balitsas kai tou idioktete tes, pou katelexan na ginoun brabeumeno muthistorema.
12. "E peripeteia enos onomatos e Giati Andreas Kapandreou"
E peripeteia kai e exelixe enos onomateponumou."�
�At the close of 1821, the penal colony of Newcastle looks to be every bit as black as it's painted. Emma Colchester charters a ride to Australia with a promise of marriage to a man she has never met. But appearances aren't always as they seem. And with a commitment unavoidable Emma learns that shackles are not always forged from iron. Tobias Freeman longs for redemption and hope. After a rough journey to New South Wales, Tobias learns the rations, the regulations, and the reprisal. But neither Emma nor Tobias expect the repercussions."�
�Sto kentro tou planete, mia terastia mproutzine pule. Mesa ap' auten, e paradeisenia pole. Ateleiotoi kepoi me ta pio perierga kai spania louloudia tou kosmou. Philntisenia ourania toxa, ktiria apo guali, elephantodonto kai metallo, katarraktes m' agiasmeno nero. Eno oi anthropoi geuontai tis khares tes athanasias, ekhontas antidota gia oles tis astheneies.
O suggrapheas ton "Metallikon istorion" steketai dikhos phobo antikru ste mousike kai te logotekhnia kai sundialegetai mazi tous khtizontas tautokhrona asphaleis gephures epikoinonias metaxu tous* e mia sumpleronei ten alle, den ten upokathista, se ena kathestos aisthetikes omoiogeneias, opou ta oria anamesa stous ekhous kai tis lexeis, ten paranoia kai ten isorropia, ten paraitese kai ten anazetese noematos, ekhoun katargethei. [...]"�
�<>
E Sammane einai e Thea tes Phuses kai tes Mageias. Otan telika ettetheke apo ton Daimona Tabaet ston polemo uper tes mageias ston epigeio kosmo, mazi me ton pisto tes akoloutho, ubridio Bika, arnountai te theike tous upostase kai metensarkonontai ste Ge, gia na ekhoun mia eukairia na einai mazi.
Otan telika, meta apo arketes metensarkoseis, sunantiountai xana, arkhizei e diadikasia tes aphupnises kai metamorphoses tous.
Tha erthoun se sugkrouse e phtharte sarka tous, ta sunaisthemata kai oi epithumies tous os anthropoi, me ten ourania upostase tous;"�
�O Odusseas Mparkas einai enas dekapentakhronos neos pou diarkos pephtei thuma kakometakheirises. E metera tou ton apaxionei, o pateras tou ton khtupa, oi summathetes tou ton koroideuoun. Mone parea ekhei ton aderpho tou ton Sam, alla kai autos ton ekmetalleuetai me kathe tropo. Anasa tha tou dosei o anomologetos erotas tou me ten Ithake Ntenie. Anasa; Meta apo ena atukhema pou tha ekhei e Ithake, gia ton Odussea arkhizei mia peripeteia, me stokho na brei ta ikhne tes agapemenes tou. Mesa apo auten ten peripeteia, to zetoumeno einai na brei ton eauto tou."�
�According to Georgian legend, God took a supper break while creating the world. He became so involved with his meal that he inadvertently tripped over the high peaks of the Caucasus, spilling his food onto the land below. The land blessed by Heaven's table scraps was Georgia.
Nestled in the Caucasus mountain range between the Black and Caspian seas, the Republic of Georgia is as beautiful as it is bountiful. The unique geography of the land, which includes both alpine and subtropical zones, has created an enviable culinary tradition. In The Georgian Feast, Darra Goldstein explores the rich and robust culture of Georgia and offers a variety of tempting recipes.
The book opens with a fifty-page description of the culture and food of Georgia. Next are over one hundred recipes, often accompanied by notes on the history of the dish. Holiday menus, a glossary of Georgian culinary terms, and an annotated bibliography round out the volume."�

