O anthropos, opos kai o kosmos, einai musteria krummena se musteria...
Mia pagkosmios anagnorismene sunthetria krubetai apo te demosioteta ligous orophous pano apo to upogeio sto opoio ena katakermatismeno mualo oneireuetai ten epistrophe sten oikogeneia tou.
Mia epistemonas paristanei ton Theo s' enan kosmo pou e tekhnologia mporei na morphopoiesei mesa sou anthropous agennetous apo te phuse.
Kai mia epaggelmatias dolophonos, pou blepei to paidi tes na sbenei, prospathei na xanapherei ste zoe ton palio sunergate tes.
Otan e euthrauste isorropia anatrepetai, te makhe gia zoe kai kuriarkhia krinei to parelthon, alla kai e agape, e bia, oi duskoles apophaseis...
Gregoro, bathu kai me auxanomene entase -san sexoualike praxe- to muthistorema auto gennaei dilemmata pou antekhoun siopela meta ten teleutaia tou lexe.
...Sto diaolo to skhedio! To soma mou kineitai mono tou. Gurnao to kephali mou kai prospatho na sekotho, alla ena dunato kheri me arpazei ap' ton omo kai me kathelonei sto stroma, eno to allo piezei ten kanne sto kranio mou....
<>
To blemma mou pephtei sta adeia kheria mou kai mono ntrope blepo ekei. Den pairno, den mporo na paro tipota mazi mou. Mono n' apheso piso mou. Okhi epiteugmata, skephtomai polu arga, mono anthropous. Athoous nekrous, agennetous plasmenous, agapemenous anuparktous, eroteumenous trelous..."�
�To megalutero meros tes drases ektulissetai s ena nesi. Mesa apo ten poreia mias oikogeneias parakolouthoume tis dekaeties pou pernoun kai tautokhrona ta gegonota pou tis semadepsan. Eroida mia gunaika, ikane gia tis kaluteres epiloges, ma steremene apo ten opoia eukairia, mesa se oria pou opote xeperniountai ekhoun kapoio timema."�
�...tote suneidetopoiesa pos autos etan o thanatos mou. Pnigomoun! E pio sosta me epnige! Den ethela pleon na bgo sten epiphaneia, oute me endiephere na anapneuso xana, apla ephera ste mneme mou ta smaragdenia matia tes, to khamogelo tes kai apophasisa na pethano me aute te skepse* ten omorphia tou prosopou tes me tis ametretes phakides; auto to gluko kai periergo plasma pou etan, prin metatrapei s' auto to teras pou me pagideuse kai me skotone arga kai basanistika."�
